The Albeda app is the official app for all students at Albeda! In the app you will find information that is important to you as a student. Everything at hand, via your smartphone!

What does the Albeda app offer?
- Your timetable and changes to the timetable;
- Your results;
- The latest Albeda news;
- Your attendance and absence;
- Handy (general) information.

MyStart Zadkine is the official app for future students of ZADKINE. Have you applied for a degree at Zadkine? Then you will have access to useful information!

With this app you can:
• Follow the procedure of your application;
• Find useful information about your degree;
• Receive important messages;
• Find FAQ and useful links for studying in the Netherlands.

